WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.698 --> 00:00:02.831
Six o'clock in the evening.

2
00:00:02.831 --> 00:00:04.514
The shop is full.

3
00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:07.365
A customer says, I don send am.

4
00:00:07.365 --> 00:00:09.198
Your phone buzzes.

5
00:00:09.198 --> 00:00:11.480
But is that money real?

6
00:00:11.977 --> 00:00:14.617
Fake alert apps can print any bank's message,

7
00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:16.424
with any amount.

8
00:00:16.424 --> 00:00:18.457
The words look perfect.

9
00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:21.425
But there is one thing a fraudster can never know.

10
00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:23.190
Your balance.

11
00:00:23.587 --> 00:00:26.597
Every real alert carries your new balance.

12
00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:30.289
Last balance, plus the amount, equals the new balance,

13
00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:31.714
to the kobo.

14
00:00:31.714 --> 00:00:34.109
A fake has to guess that number.

15
00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:36.460
And the guess is always wrong.

16
00:00:36.957 --> 00:00:38.941
This is Alertproof.

17
00:00:38.941 --> 00:00:40.577
Real alerts.

18
00:00:40.577 --> 00:00:42.130
Real checks.

19
00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.710
No fake.

20
00:00:44.507 --> 00:00:46.583
Here is how to use it.

21
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.873
Open alertproof dot tech on your phone,

22
00:00:48.873 --> 00:00:50.531
and tap Setup.

23
00:00:50.531 --> 00:00:53.534
Type your business name and your account number.

24
00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:57.155
Then open your bank app, and type today's balance.

25
00:00:57.155 --> 00:00:59.490
You only do this once.

26
00:00:59.887 --> 00:01:03.236
Now, when an alert lands, copy it.

27
00:01:03.236 --> 00:01:05.304
Open the Check tab, paste it,

28
00:01:05.304 --> 00:01:07.325
and tap Check alert.

29
00:01:07.325 --> 00:01:08.668
Gemma, an open A.I.

30
00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.087
model, reads the alert.

31
00:01:11.087 --> 00:01:14.580
Plain code makes sure every number is really written there.

32
00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.010
Then your balance decides.

33
00:01:17.307 --> 00:01:19.748
If the balance follows, it says Paid,

34
00:01:19.748 --> 00:01:22.040
and it tells you out loud.

35
00:01:22.291 --> 00:01:24.169
Money don land.

36
00:01:24.169 --> 00:01:27.980
Fifteen thousand naira don enter your account.

37
00:01:28.477 --> 00:01:30.287
If the balance does not follow,

38
00:01:30.287 --> 00:01:34.390
it says No release, and shows you the exact numbers.

39
00:01:34.642 --> 00:01:36.376
No release am.

40
00:01:36.376 --> 00:01:39.420
This alert no follow your balance.

41
00:01:39.917 --> 00:01:42.916
A customer shows you a screenshot instead?

42
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:45.183
Tap Customer screenshot.

43
00:01:45.183 --> 00:01:48.875
Alertproof reads the session I.D., the thirty digit fingerprint of

44
00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:51.082
every Nigerian bank transfer.

45
00:01:51.082 --> 00:01:53.114
It holds the sending bank's code,

46
00:01:53.114 --> 00:01:55.579
and the exact time the money moved.

47
00:01:55.579 --> 00:01:57.682
If that time does not match the time on the

48
00:01:57.682 --> 00:02:00.540
screen, the receipt was edited.

49
00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:04.191
We tested Alertproof on thirty one real bank alerts,

50
00:02:04.191 --> 00:02:06.793
and on forty five fakes made from them.

51
00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:08.954
It read every real alert correctly,

52
00:02:08.954 --> 00:02:11.200
and it stopped every fake.

53
00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:14.033
Your balance is the secret that protects you,

54
00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.161
so Alertproof keeps it on your own device.

55
00:02:17.161 --> 00:02:20.151
It runs on Gemma, an open model.

56
00:02:20.151 --> 00:02:22.686
No bill for every check, and on a laptop it

57
00:02:22.686 --> 00:02:24.690
even works offline.

58
00:02:25.087 --> 00:02:28.730
Try the demo shop now, at alertproof dot tech.

59
00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:30.247
Alertproof.

60
00:02:30.247 --> 00:02:33.710
Check the alert, before the goods leave your hand.
